<Weblab2>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2026-04-01T21:44:03.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18762,
  "properties": {
    "display_name": "Pokémon API",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>PokéStats Generator</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"dex\">\n        <div class=\"dex-top\">\n            <div class=\"light-big\"></div>\n            <div class=\"lights-row\">\n                <div class=\"light-small light-red\"></div>\n                <div class=\"light-small light-yellow\"></div>\n                <div class=\"light-small light-green\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"screen-housing\">\n            <div class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"screen-label\">Pokédex v1.0</div>\n                <h1 id=\"pokeName\">Ready?</h1>\n                <p id=\"pokeType\">---</p>\n                <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-box wide\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-label\">Base Experience</div>\n                        <div id=\"baseExp\">--</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-box\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-label\">Height</div>\n                        <div id=\"pokeHeight\">--</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-box\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-label\">Weight</div>\n                        <div id=\"pokeWeight\">--</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-box wide\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-label\">Ability</div>\n                        <div id=\"pokeAbility\">--</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dex-bottom\">\n            <button id=\"generateBtn\">Generate Pokémon</button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: white;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n}\n\n.dex {\n    background: #cc0000;\n    border: 3px solid #990000;\n    border-radius: 12px 12px 4px 4px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    max-width: 480px;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n\n.dex-top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.light-big {\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #3399ff;\n    border: 3px solid #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.lights-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 6px;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.light-small {\n    width: 12px;\n    height: 12px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.light-red { background: #ff4444; }\n.light-yellow { background: #ffcc00; }\n.light-green { background: #44cc44; }\n\n.screen-housing {\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 12px;\n    border: 3px solid #111;\n}\n\n.screen {\n    background: #1c2b1c;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 2px solid #0a150a;\n}\n\n.screen-label {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #4a7a4a;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.screen h1 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    color: #88ff88;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n}\n\n#pokeType {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #44aa44;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n}\n\n.stats-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.stat-box {\n    background: #0f1f0f;\n    border: 1px solid #2a4a2a;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 10px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #88ff88;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.stat-box.wide {\n    grid-column: span 2;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 36px;\n}\n\n#pokeAbility {\n    font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #4a7a4a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n}\n\n.dex-bottom {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n#generateBtn {\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    color: #88ff88;\n    border: 2px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 12px 32px;\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n#generateBtn:hover {\n    background: #2a2a2a;\n    border-color: #555;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const generateBtn = document.getElementById('generateBtn');\n\nconst updateUI = (data) => {\n    document.getElementById('pokeName').innerText = data.name;\n\n    let typeString = '';\n    for (let i = 0; i < data.types.length; i++) {\n        if (i > 0) typeString = typeString + ' • ';\n        typeString = typeString + data.types[i].type.name;\n    }\n    document.getElementById('pokeType').innerText = typeString;\n\n    document.getElementById('baseExp').innerText = data.base_experience;\n    document.getElementById('pokeHeight').innerText = (data.height / 10) + 'm';\n    document.getElementById('pokeWeight').innerText = (data.weight / 10) + 'kg';\n    document.getElementById('pokeAbility').innerText = data.abilities[0].ability.name.replace('-', ' ');\n    generateBtn.innerText = 'Fetch New Pokémon';\n};\n\nconst handleGenerate = () => {\n    const randomId = Math.floor(Math.random() * 898) + 1;\n    fetch('https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon/' + randomId)\n        .then(response => response.json())\n        .then(data => updateUI(data))\n        .catch(error => {\n            document.getElementById('pokeName').innerText = 'Error!';\n        });\n};\n\ngenerateBtn.addEventListener('click', handleGenerate);",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "pokemon.json",
          "language": "json",
          "contents": "{\n  \"id\": 132,\n  \"name\": \"ditto\",\n  \"base_experience\": 101,\n  \"height\": 3,\n  \"weight\": 40,\n  \"is_default\": true,\n  \"order\": 214,\n  \"abilities\": [\n    {\n      \"ability\": {\n        \"name\": \"limber\",\n        \"url\": \"https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/ability/7/\"\n      },\n      \"is_hidden\": false,\n      \"slot\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"ability\": {\n        \"name\": \"imposter\",\n        \"url\": \"https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/ability/150/\"\n      },\n      \"is_hidden\": true,\n      \"slot\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"types\": [\n    {\n      \"slot\": 1,\n      \"type\": {\n        \"name\": \"normal\",\n        \"url\": \"https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/type/1/\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"stats\": [\n    { \"base_stat\": 48, \"effort\": 1, \"stat\": { \"name\": \"hp\" } },\n    { \"base_stat\": 48, \"effort\": 0, \"stat\": { \"name\": \"attack\" } },\n    { \"base_stat\": 48, \"effort\": 0, \"stat\": { \"name\": \"defense\" } },\n    { \"base_stat\": 48, \"effort\": 0, \"stat\": { \"name\": \"special-attack\" } },\n    { \"base_stat\": 48, \"effort\": 0, \"stat\": { \"name\": \"special-defense\" } },\n    { \"base_stat\": 48, \"effort\": 0, \"stat\": { \"name\": \"speed\" } }\n  ],\n  \"forms\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ditto\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon-form/132/\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"sprites\": {\n    \"front_default\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/132.png\",\n    \"back_default\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/back/132.png\"\n  }\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "documentation.md",
          "language": "md",
          "contents": "Pokemon Documentation\n=====================\n\nid\n  The identifier for this resource.\n  Type: integer\n\n\nname\n  The name for this resource.\n  Type: string\n\n\nbase_experience\n  The base experience gained for defeating this Pokemon.\n  Type: integer\n\n\nheight\n  The height of this Pokemon in decimetres.\n  Type: integer\n\n\nis_default\n  Set for exactly one Pokemon used as the default for each species.\n  Type: boolean\n\n\norder\n  Order for sorting. Almost national order, except families are grouped together.\n  Type: integer\n\n\nweight\n  The weight of this Pokemon in hectograms.\n  Type: integer\n\n\nabilities\n  A list of abilities this Pokemon could potentially have.\n  Type: list PokemonAbility\n\n\nforms\n  A list of forms this Pokemon can take on.\n  Type: list NamedAPIResource (PokemonForm)\n\n\ngame_indices\n  A list of game indices relevant to Pokemon item by generation.\n  Type: list VersionGameIndex\n\n\nheld_items\n  A list of items this Pokemon may be holding when encountered.\n  Type: list PokemonHeldItem\n\n\nlocation_area_encounters\n  A link to a list of location areas, as well as encounter details pertaining to specific versions.\n  Type: string\n\n\nmoves\n  A list of moves along with learn methods and level details pertaining to specific version groups.\n  Type: list PokemonMove\n\n\npast_types\n  A list of details showing types this Pokemon had in previous generations.\n  Type: list PokemonTypePast\n\n\npast_abilities\n  A list of details showing abilities this Pokemon had in previous generations.\n  Type: list PokemonAbilityPast\n\n\nsprites\n  A set of sprites used to depict this Pokemon in the game.\n  Type: PokemonSprites\n\n\ncries\n  A set of cries used to depict this Pokemon in the game.\n  Type: PokemonCries",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "5",
        "4",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore the Pokemon Database\r\n\r\n1. Skim the official Pokémon API documentation in `documentation.md`.\r\n  \r\n2. Then look at the JSON response for a single Pokémon in `pokemon.json` to figure out how the data is structured. \r\n\r\n3. Use AI Tutor to help you modify your code to display different stats (like \"order\" or \"base species\").\r\n\r\n**Hint**: You can upload files like `pokemon.json` to use when prompting AI Tutor.\r\n\r\n---\r\n:::details [Not sure how to modify the code?] \r\n\r\nTry one of the following prompts:\r\n\r\n- In the file `pokemon.json`, how do I find the Pokemon's name?\r\n- How do I change the code to display \"base\\_experience\" as a percentage?\r\n- What is the difference between \"abilities\" and \"forms\" in this data?\r\n:::",
